==Event Information==
Celebrate {{Color|#FF0000|'''Three'''}} Years of Battle Cats Awesomeness!<br>
Tons of special events, sales, and challenges for you to enjoy!

{{Color|#FF00CC|'''On between September 17th (11am) and October 1st (11:59pm)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Everyone gets a First-Time Rare Draw Discount!'''}}<br>
Starting {{Color|#FF00CC|'''9/17'''}}, all players will receive a discount on their first try at a Rare Capsule draw!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''One Single Draw'''}} will cost just {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30 Cat Food'''}} instead of the normal 150 Cat Food!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''One 11-Capsule Draw'''}} will cost just {{Color|#FF00CC|'''750 Cat Food'''}} instead of the normal 1500 Cat Food!<br>
<small><small>※ If this offer does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Platinum Tickets on sale!'''}}<br>
Between {{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 17 (11:00am) and September 23 (11:59pm)'''}}, pick up tickets to use at the Platinum Capsules!<br>
Each ticket used will give you a 100% chance of drawing an Uber Rare Cat!<br>
This rare offer will only be here for a short time, so don't miss out!<br>
<small><small>※Each user will only be able to purchase one Platinum Ticket during this campaign.<br>
※If Platinum Tickets do not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.<br>
※Seasonal Event Cats, Collab Event Cats, and Girls & Monsters Cats are not available from this Platinum Capsule set.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catamin/Catfruit Limited Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catamin Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Speed up your Gamatoto! Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!<br>
<small><small>※The Catfruit Limited Capsules provide Catfruit and XP rewards, while Catamin Limited Capsules will provide Catamins and XP!<br>
※The Catamin Limited Capsules and Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 1 is completed in The Battle Cats.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● English Version Only Special Stages!'''}}<br>
*Head to the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Birthday Present!'''}} map for a special Score Stage challenge! Max out your score to collect tons of tickets and other awesome rewards!
*Take on the limited edition stage {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Minced Meet-Up'''}}, and collect the English version-only unit [[Catburger (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Catburger'''}}]]!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● The newest evolution of Catburger!'''}}<br>
Take on the awakening stage to claim the power of {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catburger's third form'''}}!<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this event to take on the limited stage {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Catburger Awakens!"'''}}<br>
Get a chance to unlock Catburger's all-new true form!<br>
<small><small>※ Upgrade Catburger to level 20 to reveal the Evolve option in the Upgrade screen!<br>
※ If you have not collected Catburger, you can still collect its third form as a drop reward and use it once you meet the Evolve conditions.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Monthly All-Star Stages!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Insane-difficulty Monthly All-Star Stages'''}} bring back all of the toughest bosses from the limited-edition Monthly Stages! Now with 3☆ Difficulty!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Special Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 17 (11am) thru September 19 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Ultra Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 20 (11am) thru September 22 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Miracle Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 23 (11am) thru September 25 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Wonderful Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 26 (11am) thru September 28 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Excellent Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Grand Jubilee'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 29 (11am) thru October 1 (11am)'''}}

Clear these stages for a chance to collect tons of XP!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Half-off energy for Empire of Cats, Into the Future, and Stories of Legend!'''}}<br>
Every day from {{Color|#FF00CC|'''18:00am～22:00am'''}}, stages from {{Color|#008000|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Into the Future'''}}, or {{Color|#FF0000|'''Stories of Legend'''}} stages will be available at half the energy cost!<br>
Check out the dates below to see when you can double your Battle Cats fun!<br>
{{Color|#008000|'''・Empire of Cats: 9/17、9/20、9/23、9/26、9/29'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Into the Future:9/18、9/21、9/24、9/27、9/30'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''・Stories of Legend: 9/19、9/22、9/25、9/28，10/1'''}}<br>
Don't miss this awesome opportunity to clear tons of stages!<br>
<small><small>※ Clear Empire of Cats Ch. 1 to receive this Half-Off Energy benefit.<br>
※ This half-off energy event does not apply to Special Stages and Collaboration Stages.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Treasure Festivals'''}}<br>
Everyday from {{Color|#FF00CC|'''12:00pm to 11:59pm'''}} during this event, {{Color|#FF6D01|'''double your chance to pick up treasure'''}} in Battle Cats story modes!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''On even days (9/18, 9/20, 9/22, 9/24, 9/26, 9/28, 9/30)'''}} challenge {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Empire of Cats'''}} for this benefit, and on {{Color|#008000|'''odd days (9/17, 9/19, 9/21, 9/23, 9/25, 9/27, 9/29, 10/1)'''}} take on {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Into the Future'''}} for extra-high drop rates!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Cat Food Rewards Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this Celebration Campaign, every day you visit the Cat Base you will be rewarded with a {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30 Cat Food'''}} present!<br>
Play every day and don't miss out on these free gifts!

